  "scope": "Keep native and legacy ingress alive on accept failures. One-second resource-error backoff keeps established sessions, timers, tasks and cancellation serviced. Native listener rearm explicitly drains queued flows. A singleton failure counter adds no message/connection policy work. The same Linux child-only64-FD probe fails three cases on the prior release and passes on selected debug/release binaries. Twelve sequential timing processes exclude builds/profiles/fault probes/competing loads. Local acceptance only.",
